<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-11-21T02:42:19.983Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 02:42:19 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraqi security forces have entered the Kataib Hezbollah stronghold of Jurf al-Sakhar and Jurf al-Nasr under a newly-brokered compromise that creates a joint security command with the militia. The deployment includes a convoy flying Iraqi flags and marks the first time the government forces have moved into these areas after a last-minute deal that averted armed clash. Prime Minister Ali al-Zaidi has also ordered a separate command for the same region, expanding state control beyond the joint arrangement. The UCDP recorded 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZ0FVX3lxTFBKVTFzNE03c0FldEFfdjd1My1Yb2ZNZlJQRmFheGczdFh3a0tsTk96RzJETWE4WTVQM2VJY2U4emhJa2RURVE1QTBydlc0YndvZV81MmhnU3JGdXdEMTRHQkdMdFFxNE0?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxOSmhZODNjd292clh2TlJBYWJNV0NuQV93UWxVTmxiMmNJaHJnNHI5WFF2bVJwOHgwcmdRS21DU3lYbGQ5aXdCVW1HbjNoaVRnSlFPRThCOFdsbTd3Y0hDUlJPci04QzdVM0d0SDhqMzVEU0VQYTUzWFNSd29FeklxbTlKWk8yQnZCV3ktZlZaOFpncHhzU3c?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxNd2NmVkpkOFlUNVlxZF8xVXhKTUpESVZ0Q0pnVllMeUxmbFBGTjl1UjdNSVg0ajhKQ01hVmYzZW1mcWxFa2VCQ0poLUdvSi1GWWtYZFJYTEZicWlBYWZmZ2ZsVzdNNE1YT09yNjVyamhNMGZsbFZwNVBxVjRWeGM1Sno4endBRnVud3JvQVNIVDVyS0ZaWGMwZkp6TXpmTkZTdlNsSEQyOA?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxNMGw4NHg3LTluajJnNG03Y1FEa0lyZklBeExybjJXdUFfNXAwdGszbUJoM25KVW5qQnhTcUxmSmh4dFEyZW1tbEtpd3JUVDhZcW8zVWwxTlUzTUFxRlAtTUZVeUlyaS0tTXloOHVaNS16b0ZQSnp2ZjFJYTl0UVRqdkRwTEp0bzhpOVM3UEVRUVBHTkozbGg1OFR0Y1J1NUlTTk8wSGFkTnNSSGRLZnNqQlJMN3oxelpRVUtMWlNqdkFSSUdh?oc